  "problem": "![](/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/capture/linear/14199831/assets/392309f189b8840862795d3b111c20956ec2366b349c6a60a6b0288052d451c2.png)\n\nGiven that $△ABC∼△VTU$ (picture is not to scale), find the similarity ratio.\n\n*Hint: Consider the ratio of the **smaller** polygon to the **larger** polygon.*",
  "worked_solution": "The similarity ratio is the ratio of the corresponding sides.\n\nSince $△ABC∼△VTU,$ the side $\\overset{―}{BC}$ corresponds to the side $\\overset{―}{TU}$\n\nTherefore, the similarity ratio is\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}k & =\\frac{BC}{TU} \\\\  & =\\frac{6}{15} \\\\  & =\\frac{2}{5}.\\end{aligned}\n$$",
